summary: Wrapper for selinux-testuite (+ extra SCTP peeloff tests)
description: |
    This TC runs a functional test suite for the LSM-based SELinux security module.

    This variant additionaly includes a proposed patch for client-side SCTP
    peeloff coverage.
contact: Ondrej Mosnacek <omosnace@redhat.com>
test: ../runtest.sh
environment:
    GIT_PATCHES: 613793
link:
